  "scope": "Reuse the generic Pell unit-advance equivalence",
  "validation": "Paired KnownUnit, FirstNorm and four direct client builds succeed with four source-matched external project providers. Three client objects are identical; FirstIndex differs. Six-object-pinned probes give 38 common declaration/type/axiom reports and equal default simp/instance registrations. The generic equivalence changes from private to public with the same type and axioms.",
  "limitations": [
    "Source-matched direct provider receipts and selected direct clients do not establish a source-current transitive closure; broader downstream clients were not rebuilt.",
    "Reports and sampled registrations do not establish equality of proof bodies or all persistent extensions. One client object differs.",
    "Compiled objects are excluded; full replay requires the original external build environment and object dependencies. Earlier exploratory baseline-only builds using an older Classification object are not part of this refreshed lane."
  ],
